meta {
  name: create
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{host}}/api/proposal
  body: multipartForm
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:multipart-form {
  judul: Proposal Penelitian AI untuk Pendidikan
  file: @file(path/to/proposal.pdf)
}

docs {
  # Create Proposal
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `POST /api/proposal`
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅  
  **Role Required:** Dosen, Mahasiswa
  
  > User yang membuat otomatis menjadi Ketua proposal
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Request Body - multipart/form-data)
  
  ```typescript
  interface CreateProposalDTO {
    judul: string;  // Required - Judul proposal
    file?: File;    // Optional - File proposal (PDF)
  }
  ```
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Validation |
  |-------|------|----------|------------|
  | judul | string | ✅ | Judul proposal |
  | file | File | ❌ | PDF |
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (201)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Proposal berhasil dibuat",
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid-proposal",
      "judul": "Proposal Penelitian AI untuk Pendidikan",
      "file_url": "/uploads/proposals/proposal.pdf",
      "status_usulan": null,
      "createdAt": "2025-01-15T10:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2025-01-15T10:00:00.000Z"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|--------|
  | 400 | Judul wajib diisi |
  | 401 | Token tidak valid |
}
